<div id="about1">
    <div class="container pixel-border2 slideIn1">
        Hi, I'm Cong Vu, a Business Information Systems student at Saskatchewan Polytechnic with a strong interest in software development. <br><br>
        Over the past year, I've been learning and building with C#, Java, Python, PHP, and JavaScript, along with tools like .NET, Git, Docker, and Linux.
        I like working on practical projects, figuring out how things work, and improving my skills by actually building things. <br><br>
        I'm comfortable using Windows, Linux, and macOS, but Linux is the system I use the most.
        It's where I do most of my coding, testing, and project work.
        This portfolio is where I share what I've been working on and what I'm learning as I keep growing as a developer.
